  "title": "Rhubarb, Strawberry, and Blueberry Cobbler",
  "description": "This rich cobbler made with rhubarb, strawberries, and blueberries is topped with an easy cinnamon batter for a fruity sweet-tart dessert.",
  "authors": [
    "gil's wife"
  ],
